379 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (I saw this LC go from 10 members attending an NGA to 50 members. Most of us here saw this change first hand. With multiple international representations, national representations and external representations, AUSSS-Ainshams was always leading. And it is because of YOU, the members. We had many setbacks, emotions, entanglements, but we never lost sight of the impact we perform. Yes, we may be a little late this year. Nonetheless, we are all still here because we want to keep this place that gave us so much. I can promise you that I will be there to help each and every one of you. I want to listen to your dreams, your fears, your ideas. Because you make up AUSSS. For our LC to grow, we start from the beginning; good old capacity building and members engagement. We listen.)
/E (I saw this LC go from 10 members attending an NGA to 50 members. Most of us here saw this change first hand. With multiple international representations, national representations and external representations, AUSSS-Ainshams was always leading. And it is because of YOU, the members. We had many setbacks, emotions, entanglements, but we never lost sight of the impact we perform. Yes, we may be a little late this year. Nonetheless, we are all still here because we want to keep this place that gave us so much. I can promise you that I will be there to help each and every one of you. I want to listen to your dreams, your fears, your ideas. Because you make up AUSSS. For our LC to grow, we start from the beginning; good old capacity building and members engagement. We listen.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [9]
>>
